            via long diagonal zigzags of extramural isomorphism clearly generalize from double complexes of size
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 3
                  %mo ×
                  %mn 3
