          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_7 Remark
            %p
              From the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/snake+lemma"} snake lemma
              one obtains in turn the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connecting+homomorphism"} connecting homomorphism
              between homology groups that leads to the long exact sequence of homology; see there for details.
          %h2#References References
          %p The salamander lemma is due to
          %ul
            %li#Bergman12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Bergman"}> George Bergman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On diagram-chasing in double complexes
              %strong 26
              (2012) 60-96 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1108.0958"}> arXiv:1108.0958
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/26/3/26-03abs.html"} tac:26-03
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/26/3/26-03.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            based on an earlier unpublished preprint which was circulated since 2007 (
            %a{:href => "http://sbseminar.files.wordpress.com/2007/11/diagramchasingbergman.pdf"}> pdf
            ).
          %p Exposition:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anton+Geraschenko"}> Anton Geraschenko
              ,
              %em The Salamander lemma
              (2007) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://sbseminar.wordpress.com/2007/11/13/anton-geraschenko-the-salamander-lemma/"}> blog post
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            An alternative proof (also of the
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/snake+lemma"} snake lemma
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+properties"} universal properties
          %ul
            %li#Wise
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Wise"}> Jonathan Wise
              , §4 in:
              %em A non-elementary proof of the snake lemma
              (2011, 2023) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://math.colorado.edu/%7Ejonathan.wise/papers/snake.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Wise-SnakeLemma.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/a/7531/381"} MO:a/7531
